      "fontSize": 15.344401041666668,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "The agent may only ever set dropped / needs_review / resume_ready. Everything from 'applied' onward is human-owned, and a regression guard refuses backward moves.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The agent may only ever set dropped / needs_review / resume_ready. Everything from 'applied' onward is human-owned, and a regression guard refuses backward moves.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "b0k"
    },
    {
      "id": "z4n3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 64.29752604166667,
